# Generated by a run. results/ is scratch and stays out of git.
#
# artifacts/ is the DELIBERATE EXCEPTION the convention allows and asks to be
# stated: model.mps, model.lp and solution.sol are committed on purpose, because
# they are what makes the published result checkable by someone with no solver
# and no licence. They are the frozen instance, not regenerable scratch - a
# fresh run produces a different incumbent. See README, "Verify it without a
# solver".
results/*.sol
results/*.lp
results/*.mps
results/tables/*
results/figures/*
!results/.gitkeep

# Never
.env
*.lic
gurobi.log

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
